  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "style": "Title",
      "text": "Library reminder pilot decision"
    },
    {
      "style": "Subtitle",
      "text": "For the program lead | Prepared by the planning team | 29 September 2026"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Approve a two-session reminder pilot for people who have already agreed to receive session updates. The…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Decision requested"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Authorize one staff member to prepare and send one reminder before each of two library workshops. Use…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Why this decision is bounded"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "The demonstration records on the next page show repeated questions about where to arrive, but do not…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Conditions before starting"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Decision record: approval is pending. Record the actual decision, date and decision maker before work…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading1",
      "text": "Evidence and limits"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Separate a recorded observation from what it might mean. The examples below illustrate the reasoning…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Interpretation"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "The records support testing a clearer message. They do not justify a wider communication campaign or a…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Evidence that would change the recommendation"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Do not run the pilot if contact permission cannot be confirmed or if no one can respond to replies. If…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Source record locations: E01 host notes, E02 reviewed message, E03 baseline decision log. These are…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading1",
      "text": "Alternatives and follow through"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Strongest objection"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "The pilot may add work without reducing confusion. That is a reasonable concern. Keep the message…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Owner and review"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "The session host owns the pilot record. Within two working days after the second session, the host…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Stop and revisit conditions"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Stop if a recipient asks to leave the update list, if details change after review, or if replies exceed…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading2",
      "text": "Decision entry"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Decision and reason: ______________________________________________________ Decision maker and date:…"
    },
    {
      "style": "Heading1",
      "text": "Extended evidence register"
    },
    {
      "style": "Normal",
      "text": "Fictional planning fixture. These records describe evidence needed to judge the reminder pilot; they…"
    }
  ],
